PwC에 따르면 급여가 아닌 소득에는 실제로 IPR이 매겨지지 않고, 해외 소득도 과세되지 않습니다. 퇴직 수당은 10%, 일용직 급여는 15%의 별도 세율이며, 외국인 직원을 고용한 회사는 따로 외국인 급여 특별세(IERE, 25%)를 냅니다.","note_en":"The DR Congo's personal income tax is the professional income tax (IPR, Impôt professionnel sur les rémunérations) levied on salaries. According to PwC, non-salary income is in practice not subject to IPR and foreign-source income is not taxed. Termination payments are taxed at 10% and casual workers' pay at 15%, and companies employing expatriates pay a separate exceptional tax on expatriates' pay (IERE) of 25%.","src":[["PwC Worldwide Tax Summaries","Congo, Democratic Republic of the — Taxes on personal income (콩고민주공화국 개인소득세), 2026-04-21 검토","https://taxsummaries.pwc.com/democratic-republic-of-the-congo/individual/taxes-on-personal-income","research"]]}}}